{"parentUuid":"a2760fb0-91a8-4728-81b1-d8f1198d3f29","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgT7TE6RFDMmG4BAHzD3m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UqyiqeJbJroYxhmWfQgsVr","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker/CLAUDE.md","old_string":"- Benchmark script: `scripts/benchmark.ts`. Fixture images: `fixtures/`.","new_string":"- Benchmark script: `scripts/benchmark.ts`. Fixture images: `fixtures/`, ground truth in `fixtures/manifest.json`.\n- Fixtures never depict notable people (anyone with a Wikipedia article). Models already know them, which inflates OCR and grounding scores. Same-name namesakes are allowed and noted as identity traps.\n- Modern graves (death 1900+) are the fixture baseline. Historic stones are a minority that stress-test reading, never the norm."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":239181,"output_tokens":814,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":136},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":239181,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":478},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01UqyiqeJbJroYxhmWfQgsVr":{"file_path":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker/CLAUDE.md","old_string":"- Benchmark script: `scripts/benchmark.ts`. Fixture images: `fixtures/`.","new_string":"- Benchmark script: `scripts/benchmark.ts`. Fixture images: `fixtures/`, ground truth in `fixtures/manifest.json`.\n- Fixtures never depict notable people (anyone with a Wikipedia article). Models already know them, which inflates OCR and grounding scores. Same-name namesakes are allowed and noted as identity traps.\n- Modern graves (death 1900+) are the fixture baseline. Historic stones are a minority that stress-test reading, never the norm."}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgT7TDVD13XNDgXDuLahZ","requestRef":"4c0e678a-022e-4230-9690-dd3bba70d85e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionSkill":"generate-commit-message","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c39fc0e-2b9b-448c-9df6-8a08088edc8b","timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:10:01.554Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e8fe1454-894d-486c-ada2-536b95330a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/benchmark-fixtures"}
