ty that stress-test reading, never the norm.\n- Ground truth is unverified until the user reviews it (`reviewed: true`). Never publish benchmark numbers from unreviewed fixtures."}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgT7khfqDDmfxr97sAP5u","requestRef":"bd86b776-eec6-4ef9-bbe7-ecd853dd3772","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"794cc6e9-dd74-4a18-8ace-75fce83e4b5e","timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:13:57.647Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e8fe1454-894d-486c-ada2-536b95330a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/benchmark-fixtures"}
