{"parentUuid":"9d23a1a1-7fd2-49eb-b5da-e64f22e1dfca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgT7u2wfiDW6hrf6zfFjS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fixture set is down to 9 photos, and a review page for the answer key is live: **https://claude.ai/artifact/2xtJSGENbbvQBMcHxyGKsZ**\n\n## Fixtures: 9 photos (14 MB)\n- **6 graves from 2011–2025:**\n  - `chambers-2011`, `gonzalez-2021` (Spanish epitaph), `guo-2025` (Chinese and English).\n  - `hildebrand-jr-2015` and `hildebrand-iii-2018`: same name, only Jr vs III tells them apart, so they must not be merged.\n  - `holmquist-2024`: the wife has no death date and may be living. \"46 years\" on the stone is the marriage length, not an age.\n- **3 historic stones:** `cunningham-1752` (legible), `ellis-1818` (partly legible), `illegible-marble` (unreadable).\n- **New field:** every entry has `reviewed: false` until you check it.\n- **`CLAUDE.md`:** graves from 2010 on are the fixture baseline, and benchmark numbers can't be published from unreviewed fixtures.\n- **Commits on `test/benchmark-fixtures`:**\n  - `2d9c116` test: trim fixtures to 9 with post-2010 graves as the baseline\n  - `4ad7e5a` docs: make post-2010 graves the fixture baseline and gate on review\n\n## Review page\n- Each card shows the photo (tap for full size) beside my reading of the stone.\n- Edit any field, add or remove a person, or hit **Mark illegible**.\n- **Save** records it as `confirmed` if unchanged, `corrected` if you edited anything. A counter tracks how many are done.\n- Dates are `YYYY` or `YYYY-MM-DD`, with `?` for a digit you can't read. Leave a field blank if it isn't on the stone or can't be read.\n- Saves go to the page's own store; nothing touches the repo until I apply them.\n- **Tested:** the store reads back empty, as it should before any saves. I haven't run a test save, so your first one is the real check.\n- **Next step:** tell me when you're done. I'll pull your saves into `fixtures/manifest.json`, set `reviewed: true`, and commit.\n\n## Decision for you\n- **Repo bloat:** this unpushed branch's history still holds the earlier 24-photo set. Those images would ship to GitHub forever if pushed as-is.\n- **Fix:** before any push, squash the three fixture commits into one so only the final 9 photos are stored.\n- **Why I'm asking:** that rewrites history, which the commit skill forbids without your go-ahead. Say \"squash\" and I'll do it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":215,"cache_read_input_tokens":303613,"output_tokens":955,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":54},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":215,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":955,"cache_read_input_tokens":303613,"cache_creation_input_tokens":215,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":215},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgT7u2JiURoTZ9sTpj1Yc","requestRef":"e0ca9f73-c671-4e0e-b75d-37dc3487bbeb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionSkill":"artifact-capabilities","type":"assistant","uuid":"d115c21c-22ee-424e-9d88-b4d0bcebcda4","timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:15:56.755Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e8fe1454-894d-486c-ada2-536b95330a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker/fixtures","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/benchmark-fixtures"}
