k; Chinese name (郭俊士) above romanised name.\","," \t\t\"source\": \"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jim_Jiunn-Shih_Guo_(1937-2025)_brick_at_Davis_Cemetery_in_Davis,_California.jpg\","," \t\t\"author\": \"Richard Arthur Norton (1958- )\","," \t\t\"license\": \"CC BY-SA 4.0\","]},{"oldStart":57,"oldLines":6,"newStart":57,"newLines":7,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"hildebrand-iii-2018.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"clean\",","+\t\t\"text\": \"Edward Hildebrand III\\n\\\"Eddie Boy\\\"\\n1966 - 2018\\nOur Beloved Son and Brother\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"," \t\t\t\t\"name\": \"Edward Hildebrand III\","]},{"oldStart":64,"oldLines":7,"newStart":65,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\t\t\"died\": \"2018\""," \t\t\t}"," \t\t],","-\t\t\"notes\": \"Laser-etched flat marker; nickname \\\"Eddie Boy\\\". Same cemetery as hildebrand-jr-2015: different person, must not merge.\","," \t\t\"source\": \"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Edward_Hildebrand_(1966-2018)_in_Alsea_Cemetery.jpg\","," \t\t\"author\": \"Rick Obst\","," \t\t\"license\": \"CC BY 2.0\","]},{"oldStart":75,"oldLines":6,"newStart":75,"newLines":7,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"hildebrand-jr-2015.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"clean\",","+\t\t\"text\": \"EDWARD\\nLEROY\\nHILDEBRAND JR\\nADR3\\nUS NAVY\\nVIETNAM\\nAPR 28 1942\\nOCT 10 2015\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"," \t\t\t\t\"name\": \"Edward Leroy Hildebrand Jr\","]},{"oldStart":82,"oldLines":7,"newStart":83,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\t\t\"died\": \"2015-10-10\""," \t\t\t}"," \t\t],","-\t\t\"notes\": \"Upright VA marker: rate ADR3, US Navy, Vietnam. Generational suffix is the only name difference from hildebrand-iii-2018.\","," \t\t\"source\": \"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Edward_Hildebrand_(1942-2015)_in_Alsea_Cemetery.jpg\","," \t\t\"author\": \"Rick Obst\","," \t\t\"license\": \"CC BY 2.0\","]},{"oldStart":93,"oldLines":6,"newStart":93,"newLines":7,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"holmquist-2024.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"edge\",","+\t\t\"text\": \"HOLMQUIST\\nMARSHA FOX\\n11-5-1940\\nCHARLES RAY\\n3-12-1948\\n5-6-2024\\n46 YEARS\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"," \t\t\t\t\"name\": \"Marsha Fox Holmquist\","]},{"oldStart":105,"oldLines":7,"newStart":106,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\t\t\"died\": \"2024-05-06\""," \t\t\t}"," \t\t],","-\t\t\"notes\": \"Companion stone; spouse has no death date and may be living. Numeric M-D-Y dates. '46 years' is marriage length, not age.\","," \t\t\"source\": \"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oak_Hill_Cemetery_-_Holmquist,_Charles_Ray_(1948-2024).jpg\","," \t\t\"author\": \"Rick Obst\","," \t\t\"license\": \"CC BY 2.0\","]},{"oldStart":116,"oldLines":6,"newStart":116,"newLines":7,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"cunningham-1752.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"historic\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"weathered\",","+\t\t\"text\": \"HERE LYES BURIED\\nTHE BODY OF\\nMr ANDREW CUNNINGHAM\\nWHO DEPARTED THIS LIFE\\nAPRIL 27th 1752 IN THE\\n60th YEAR OF HIS AGE\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"," \t\t\t\t\"name\": \"Andrew Cunningham\","]},{"oldStart":123,"oldLines":7,"newStart":124,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\t\t\"died\": \"1752-04-27\""," \t\t\t}"," \t\t],","-\t\t\"notes\": \"Colonial slate, 'Mr' honorific, superscript 'th'. 60th year of age. Legible baseline for historic stones.\","," \t\t\"source\": \"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Andrew_Cunningham_headstone_(36114).jpg\","," \t\t\"author\": \"Rhododendrites\","," \t\t\"license\": \"CC BY-SA 4.0\","]},{"oldStart":134,"oldLines":6,"newStart":134,"newLines":7,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"ellis-1818.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"historic\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"weathered\",","+\t\t\"text\": \"In\\nMemory of\\nBETSEY ELLIS,\\nDaughter of\\nThos. & Betsey Ellis,\\nwho died\\nJuly 28, 1818,\\nag'd 11 years.\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"," \t\t\t\t\"name\": \"Betsey Ellis\","]},{"oldStart":141,"oldLines":7,"newStart":142,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\t\t\"died\": \"1818-07-28\""," \t\t\t}"," \t\t],","-\t\t\"notes\": \"Lichen, branch shadows, script lettering. Daughter of Thos. & Betsey Ellis, aged 11.\","," \t\t\"source\": \"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Betsey_Ellis_tombstone,_Savery_Cemetery,_Ellisville_MA.jpg\","," \t\t\"author\": \"John Phelan\","," \t\t\"license\": \"CC BY-SA 3.0\","]},{"oldStart":152,"oldLines":8,"newStart":152,"newLines":8,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"illegible-marble.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"historic\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"illegible\",","+\t\t\"text\": null,"," \t\t\"people\": [],","-\t\t\"notes\": \"19th-century marble eroded and stained. App must say it can't read the stone.\","," \t\t\"source\": \"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Illegible_20-10-15_050.jpg\","," \t\t\"author\": \"Chris Light\","," \t\t\"license\": \"CC BY-SA 4.0\","]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker/fixtures/manifest.json"]}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8a68f641-6005-42c7-895b-57141a0fefd1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"e8fe1454-894d-486c-ada2-536b95330a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/benchmark-fixtures"}
