{"parentUuid":"373f1452-88bc-43f1-86e4-7f184e0e3770","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"35214278-acd8-4667-a2e2-d6b6bda3fddc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G6HZtmKaaxUd4eqx7omKZ8","type":"tool_result","content":"60e756e test: mark the headstone answer key as human-reviewed\n138e1a1 chore: drop gitignore entries for hosts and files this repo never uses\n0a2fb9b build: keep benchmark fixtures out of the Docker build context\n2810dd1 docs: set fixture rules for the headstone benchmark\nc1cc170 test: add 9 headstone fixtures with ground truth for the benchmark\nfixtures/manifest.json:0\nCLAUDE.md:0\nchecks=0","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"63f1f548-99cb-4166-b571-6dbf5683bff5","timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:31:12.638Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"60e756e test: mark the headstone answer key as human-reviewed\n138e1a1 chore: drop gitignore entries for hosts and files this repo never uses\n0a2fb9b build: keep benchmark fixtures out of the Docker build context\n2810dd1 docs: set fixture rules for the headstone benchmark\nc1cc170 test: add 9 headstone fixtures with ground truth for the benchmark\nfixtures/manifest.json:0\nCLAUDE.md:0\nchecks=0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker/CLAUDE.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":59,"oldLines":7,"newStart":59,"newLines":6,"lines":[" - Fixtures never depict notable people (anyone with a Wikipedia article). Models already know them, which inflates OCR and grounding scores. Same-name namesakes are allowed and noted as identity traps."," - Keep the fixture set small. Recent graves (death 2010+) are the baseline. Historic stones are a minority that stress-test reading, never the norm."," - Ground truth is unverified until the user reviews it (`reviewed: true`). Never publish benchmark numbers from unreviewed fixtures.","-- `scored: false` fixtures run in the benchmark but stay out of headline numbers. Multi-person stones are a non-goal: report the result, never tune for it."," - Deploy: `deploy.sh` → one Cloud Run service in GCP project `anchildress1`. API keys come from Secret Manager, never env files in the image."," - Lint, type, and test warnings are errors."," - Secrets live in `.env` only (gitignored). `.env.example` lists keys with empty values."]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker/fixtures/manifest.json","hunks":[{"oldStart":3,"oldLines":7,"newStart":3,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"chambers-2011.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"clean\",","-\t\t\"scored\": true,"," \t\t\"text\": \"CORWIN \\\"CORY\\\" GARNER\\nCHAMBERS\\nNOV. 7, 1959 — SEP. 12, 2011\\n\\\"IMPOSSIBLE IS NOTHING\\\"\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"]},{"oldStart":22,"oldLines":7,"newStart":21,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"gonzalez-2021.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"clean\",","-\t\t\"scored\": true,"," \t\t\"text\": \"Amado esposo, hermano y padre\\nAlfonso Gonzalez\\nNov. 18, 1951 - Jan. 17, 2021\\nSalmos 73:26\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"]},{"oldStart":41,"oldLines":7,"newStart":39,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"guo-2025.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"clean\",","-\t\t\"scored\": true,"," \t\t\"text\": \"郭俊士\\nJiunn-Shih Guo\\nJan. 18, 1937\\nDec. 10, 2025\\nBeloved Husband,\\nFather and\\nGrandfather\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"]},{"oldStart":60,"oldLines":7,"newStart":57,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"hildebrand-iii-2018.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"clean\",","-\t\t\"scored\": true,"," \t\t\"text\": \"Edward Hildebrand III\\n\\\"Eddie Boy\\\"\\n1966 - 2018\\nOur Beloved Son and Brother\","," \t\t\"people\": ["," \t\t\t{"]},{"oldStart":79,"oldLines":7,"newStart":75,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\"file\": \"hildebrand-jr-2015.jpg\","," \t\t\"era\": \"recent\","," \t\t\"difficulty\": \"clean\",",