{"parentUuid":"af838d41-1177-43ab-b27c-a0dbcb847834","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTAF4jsCjttxNxmtYGUD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No results yet: the first run crashed before saving anything, so I fixed the script and restarted it in the background.\n\n- **Cause:** one Gemma call hung longer than Node's 5-minute default request timeout, and the script didn't handle it.\n- **Fix:** each call now gives up after 4 minutes and is recorded as a failed answer for that model. Results also save after every call, so a crash can't wipe the run again.\n- **Not the repo benchmark:** `scripts/benchmark.ts` doesn't exist yet. This is a throwaway script in my scratch folder, so the run checks how well the models read and nothing lands in the repo.\n- **Models:** `gemma-4-26b-a4b-it`, `gemma-4-31b-it` and the closed `gemini-3.8-flash`. All three get the same prompt and all 9 fixtures, `holmquist-2024` included.\n\nThe rerun takes about 15 minutes. I'll check the name mismatches against the raw answers before giving you numbers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1756,"cache_read_input_tokens":340967,"output_tokens":367,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":38},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1756,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":367,"cache_read_input_tokens":340967,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1756},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgTAF3uzh2GoCZYWRWysy","requestRef":"2f21193d-cc3f-425a-b14d-783