{"parentUuid":"89c609f5-0c5c-4a48-a518-b92adf99ff99","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"35537cc9-ba97-458d-9db8-2b66ba5461e6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DhGTtinwiqPKsvBUugBVVa","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemma 4 model sizes E2B E4B 26B A4B 31B release\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Google Releases Gemma 4: Frontier Open Models Under Apache 2.0\",\"url\":\"https://rits.shanghai.nyu.edu/ai/google-releases-gemma-4-frontier-open-models-under-apache-2-0/\"},{\"title\":\"ai.google.dev\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/releases?hl=en\"},{\"title\":\"www.issoh.co.jp\",\"url\":\"https://www.issoh.co.jp/tech/details/11651/\"},{\"title\":\"Simon Willison’s Weblog\",\"url\":\"https://simonwillison.net/b/9404\"},{\"title\":\"本頁面記錄 Gemma 系列模型的版本。\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/releases?hl=zh-TW\"},{\"title\":\"ai.google.dev\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/core\"},{\"title\":\"gemma 4\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/edge/litert-lm/models/gemma-4\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Market Blog\",\"url\":\"https://claudemarket.ai/blog/gemma-4-google-open-model\"},{\"title\":\"ai.google.dev\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/releases?hl=it\"}]\n\nThe search turned up the original Gemma 4 lineup and a later addition, which you should know about because your query didn't include it.\n\n- **Original launch (March 31 to April 2, 2026):** The family came in four sizes: E2B and E4B for edge devices, plus a 26B mixture-of-experts model and a 31B dense model. E2B has 2.3B effective parameters, E4B has 4.5B effective, 26B A4B has 26B total with 3.8B active, and 31B Dense has 30.7B parameters. Google's release log dates the launch to March 31, 2026, while a secondary source gives April 2 for the public announcement.\n- **Context and features:** The edge models have 128K context and native audio input, and the two larger models have 256K context. Video processing is supported across the family.\n- **Later additions:** Google's release page lists Gemma 4 - MTP for E2B, E4B, 31B, and 26B A4B on April 16, 2026, and Gemma 4 12B Unified on June 3, 2026. The developer docs describe the 12B as a 12B parameter encoder free model for multimodal tasks, which makes five sizes in total. Only the four original sizes appear in the other sources I found, so the 12B's details are less well confirmed.\n- **Naming note:** One Japanese guide lists the 26B MoE as 25.2B total parameters with 3.8B active, which conflicts with the 26B figure in the other sources.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"ba6948ea-cf6b-4dcf-9382-cb1ef653bb52","timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:18:28.854Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Gemma 4 model sizes E2B E4B 26B A4B 31B release","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01757hevDubc6vFQsAVqchka","content":[{"title":"Google Releases Gemma 4: Frontier Open Models Under Apache 2.0","url":"https://rits.shanghai.nyu.edu/ai/google-releases-gemma-4-frontier-open-models-under-apache-2-0/"},{"title":"ai.google.dev","url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/releases?hl=en"},{"title":"www.issoh.co.jp","url":"https://www.issoh.co.jp/tech/details/11651/"},{"title":"Simon Willison’s Weblog","url":"https://simonwillison.net/b/9404"},{"title":"本頁面記錄 Gemma 系列模型的版本。","url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/releases?hl=zh-TW"},{"title":"ai.google.dev","url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/core"},{"title":"gemma 4","url":"https://ai.google.dev/edge/litert-lm/models/gemma-4"},{"title":"Claude Market Blog","url":"https://claudemarket.ai/blog/gemma-4-google-open-model"},{"title":"ai.google.dev","url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/releases?hl=it"}]},"The search turned up the original Gemma 4 lineup and a later addition, which you should know about because your query didn't include it.\n\n- **Original launch (March 31 to April 2, 2026):** The family came in four sizes: E2B and E4B for edge devices, plus a 26B mixture-of-experts model and a 31B dense model. E2B has 2.3B effective parameters, E4B has 4.5B effective, 26B A4B has 26B total with 3.8B active, and 31B Dense has 30.7B parameters. Google's release log dates the launch to March 31, 2026, while a secondary source gives April 2 for the public announcement.\n- **Context and features:** The edge models have 128K context and native audio input, and the two larger models have 256K context. Video processing is supported across the family.\n- **Later additions:** Google's release page lists Gemma 4 - MTP for E2B, E4B, 31B, and 26B A4B on April 16, 2026, and Gemma 4 12B Unified on June 3, 2026. The developer docs describe the 12B as a 12B parameter encoder free model for multimodal tasks, which makes five sizes in total. Only the four original sizes appear in the other sources I found, so the 12B's details are less well confirmed.\n- **Naming note:** One Japanese guide lists the 26B MoE as 25.2B total parameters with 3.8B active, which conflicts with the 26B figure in the other sources."],"durationSeconds":6.987362207999453,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"89c609f5-0c5c-4a48-a518-b92adf99ff99","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"e8fe1454-894d-486c-ada2-536b95330a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/benchmark-fixtures"}
