 was about 3D rendering (GPU choice for Blender/V-Ray-style workloads, render farm trends), not Render the hosting platform, so I can't confirm its 2026 GPU instance support from these results.\n\nI didn't search the DigitalOcean GPU Droplets or Gemma inference part of your query, since you asked for a single search. I can run a separate search for either one. For Render, checking its official docs or pricing page would be the most reliable route.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"964f7642-21d8-4215-8d17-5878695b614e","timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:18:29.200Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Render GPU instances support 2026; DigitalOcean GPU Droplets serverless inference Gemma","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_019kyJKq6RVJcw5dQjKQdHBs","content":[{"title":"2026'da Render İçin En İyi 8 GPU (İnceleme ve Kıyas)","url":"https://www.myarchitectai.com/tr/blog/best-gpu-for-rendering"},{"title":"gpu ai render trends 2026 neural rendering render farms","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/es/article/gpu-ai-render-trends-2026-neural-rendering-render-farms"},{"title":"gpu ai render trends 2026 neural rendering render farms","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/pt-pt/article/gpu-ai-render-trends-2026-neural-rendering-render-farms"},{"title":"gpu ai render trends 2026 neural rendering render farms","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/it/article/gpu-ai-render-trends-2026-neural-rendering-render-farms"},{"title":"gpu ai render trends 2026 neural rendering render farms","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/article/gpu-ai-render-trends-2026-neural-rendering-render-farms"},{"title":"gpu ai render trends 2026 neural rendering render farms","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/fr/article/gpu-ai-render-trends-2026-neural-rendering-render-farms"},{"title":"gpu ai render trends 2026 neural rendering render farms","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/de/article/gpu-ai-render-trends-2026-neural-rendering-render-farms"},{"title":"gpu ai render trends 2026 neural rendering render farms","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/vi/article/gpu-ai-render-trends-2026-neural-rendering-render-farms"},{"title":"best gpu for 3d rendering 2026","url":"https://superrendersfarm.com/vi/article/best-gpu-for-3d-rendering-2026"}]},"The search didn't return anything on Render's cloud GPU offering. Every result was about 3D rendering (GPU choice for Blender/V-Ray-style workloads, render farm trends), not Render the hosting platform, so I can't confirm its 2026 GPU instance support from these results.\n\nI didn't search the DigitalOcean GPU Droplets or Gemma inference part of your query, since you asked for a single search. I can run a separate search for either one. For Render, checking its official docs or pricing page would be the most reliable route."],"durationSeconds":5.559162500000559,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"953100ac-7d76-4baa-acef-5ad0170ebea7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"e8fe1454-894d-486c-ada2-536b95330a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/benchmark-fixtures"}
