{"parentUuid":"6ff125fd-1ddb-4733-9a41-d1b7bd776075","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"35537cc9-ba97-458d-9db8-2b66ba5461e6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017iYwKH7WR4jwK6Gku7R6BX","type":"tool_result","content":"**Gemma 4**\n- **Free tier:** Input, output, and context caching are listed as \"Free of charge.\"\n- **Paid tier:** Input, output, context caching, tuning, and grounding are all \"Not available.\"\n- **Rate limits:** The page doesn't state rate limits for Gemma. It links to a separate \"Rate limits\" page, but gives no figures here.\n\n**Gemini 3.8 Flash (Standard, per 1M tokens, USD)**\n- **Input price:** Free tier is \"Free of charge.\" Paid tier is \"$0.75 through December 31, 2026.\" then \"$1.50 starting January 1, 2027.\"\n- **Output price (including thinking tokens):** Free tier is \"Free of charge.\" Paid tier is \"$3.75 through December 31, 2026.\" then \"$7.50 starting January 1, 2027.\"\n- **Image input:** The page gives no separate image price for this model. The single input price row is the only input rate listed."}]},"uuid":"125af269-7b7a-42a7-8057-54d61d6bc94d","timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:18:52.661Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":253874,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Gemma 4**\n- **Free tier:** Input, output, and context caching are listed as \"Free of charge.\"\n- **Paid tier:** Input, output, context caching, tuning, and grounding are all \"Not available.\"\n- **Rate limits:** The page doesn't state rate limits for Gemma. It links to a separate \"Rate limits\" page, but gives no figures here.\n\n**Gemini 3.8 Flash (Standard, per 1M tokens, USD)**\n- **Input price:** Free tier is \"Free of charge.\" Paid tier is \"$0.75 through December 31, 2026.\" then \"$1.50 starting January 1, 2027.\"\n- **Output price (including thinking tokens):** Free tier is \"Free of charge.\" Paid tier is \"$3.75 through December 31, 2026.\" then \"$7.50 starting January 1, 2027.\"\n- **Image input:** The page gives no separate image price for this model. The single input price row is the only input rate listed.","durationMs":8332,"url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6ff125fd-1ddb-4733-9a41-d1b7bd776075","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"e8fe1454-894d-486c-ada2-536b95330a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/benchmark-fixtures"}
