{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"a78fbb29-c412-483a-b679-0722adb27f13","hash":"80648ad2136ecb9ec23155f8850ad9ec90d68735f40759a4f800f2dee606ce1c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now CLAUDE.md: the retries line conflicts with the Mastra requirement."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Bri8pXkoCky5ZCobx8wWd8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/anchildress1/git_personal/gravespeaker && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np=\"CLAUDE.md\"; s=open(p).read()\na=\"- No feature flags, plugin systems, config layers, caching, retries, queues, or i18n unless a broken user path demands it.\\n\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,a+\"- Exception: model and search calls use Mastra's built-in retry and error handling. Never hand-roll retries.\\n- Model output passes through a deterministic layer that parses names and normalizes dates. Never trust the model's formatting.\\n- Non-English inscriptions are not optimized for. Never add code that rejects them either.\\n\")\nopen(p,\"w\").write(s)\nEOF\npnpm exec prettier --check CLAUDE.md docs/PRD.md && git add CLAUDE.md docs/PRD.md && git commit -q -S -F - <<'EOF' 2>&1 | tail -3; git --no-pager log -1 --oneline\ndocs: require Mastra retries and a deterministic parsing layer\n\n- route model and search calls through Mastra's built-in retry and error handling\n- parse names and normalize dates in code instead of trusting model formatting\n- carve the Mastra retries out of the no-retries scope rule\n\nSigned-off-by: Ashley Childress <anchildress1@gmail.com>\nGenerated-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF","description":"Update CLAUDE.md scope rules and commit with PRD requirements"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
